      "html": "<span class=\"bp-ddw\" data-force-furigana=\"default\"><ruby class=\"cursor-pointer\">生物<rp>(</rp><rt>せいぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が</span><button title=\"Return to the question input\"><span class=\"inline-block  text-correct\"><span class=\"bp-ddw\" data-force-furigana=\"default\"><ruby class=\"cursor-pointer\">好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き</span></span></button><span class=\"bp-ddw\" data-force-furigana=\"default\">。</span>",
